WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,800
This is my Jincun’s food.

2
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:04,520
If you dare to fool your Mr. Liu, search it for me.

3
00:00:08,900 --> 00:00:10,500
Gu Yunxi and the others should tidy up for a while.

4
00:00:11,300 --> 00:00:12,860
I don't want the house I just picked out

5
00:00:13,340 --> 00:00:14,820
The door was broken down by someone.

6
00:00:15,140 --> 00:00:16,980
I really don’t have anything to eat at home

7
00:00:17,380 --> 00:00:19,780
The door is also broken. Wake up. Don't damage it.

8
00:00:22,780 --> 00:00:23,740
The refrigerator and kitchen are empty

9
00:00:23,740 --> 00:00:25,700
I don't have anyone to eat from or the kitchen.

10
00:00:27,620 --> 00:00:28,620
There is a little girl doll

11
00:00:28,980 --> 00:00:38,170
This is quite pretty and tender, so you can take it away
